WEBVTT

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.000
The heavens, the earth, and the netherworld

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.100
shall have one ultimate ruler.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.000
Whenever the universe faces a severe threat,

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.804
Lord Vishnu has taken an

00:00:59.804 --> 00:01:02.060
avatar in order to protect it.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:09.720
My firstborn, Ram.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.500
I would gladly sacrifice my life

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.520
for the welfare of the world.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:38.886
It is my duty to

00:01:38.886 --> 00:01:41.000
uphold my father's word, Mother Kaikeyi.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.000
For you,

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:46.700
14 years of exile.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.420
On the day of our wedding

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.840
we made vows to one another.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:59.900
Our fates are now forever intertwined.
